2. Each of the following is prescribed as a law enforcement agency for the purposes of section 48(2) of the Act:
(a)Singapore Police Force;
(b)Central Narcotics Bureau;
(c)Immigration & Checkpoints Authority;
(d)Internal Security Department;
(e)Gambling Regulatory Authority of Singapore;
[S 562/2025 wef 01/09/2025]
(f)Health Sciences Authority.
[S 562/2025 wef 01/09/2025]
